//: GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind: compositor frame entry prepare の[失敗/しっぱい][段階/だんかい]
//:
//: bitmap frame prepare、row batch plan prepare、row batch cursor start のどこで owner-bearing prepare が[止/と]まったかを lower error kind として[保持/ほじ]します。
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
//: ```neplg2
//:| #import "alloc/gui/render2d/compositor_frame_entry" as *
//: ```
pub enum GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind:
    BitmapFramePrepareFailed %GuiRgba8888BitmapFramePrepareErrorKind
    RowBatchPlanPrepareFailed %GuiRgba8888RowBatchPlanPrepareErrorKind
    RowBatchCursorStartFailed %GuiRgba8888RowBatchCursorErrorKind

impl Clone for GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind \kind:
        *kind

impl Copy for GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryPrepareErrorKind \kind:
        kind

//: GuiRgba8888CompositorFrameEntryConfig: compositor frame entry prepare の[設定/せってい]
//:
//: frame id と 1 batch [当/あ]たりの[最大/さいだい] row [数/すう]を lower bitmap frame / row batch plan 境界へ[渡/わた]す Copy value です。
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
//: ```neplg2
